            "name": "Bouncing Odyssey",
            "steam_appid": 660760,
            "required_age": 0,
            "is_free": false,
            "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/660760/extras/260e1b5740abfd5155d4f1585ddbdf5b.avif?t=1513538504\" width=612 height=104 /></span><br>Bouncing Odyssey is a logic puzzle game. Quite challenging puzzles and very unusual but attractive hand-drawn graphics (made on paper with PENCIL) are the main characteristics of the game.<br><br>Main mechanic is simple. Set your position and direction and, with the use of <i>the law of reflection</i>, you must escape the screen and simultaneously decolorize all the colored objects on the screen.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> 75 challenging and handcrafted levels + one <i>special final level</i><br></li><li> Four worlds with five different game mechanics:<br>- Basic mechanics - <strong>THE LAW OF REFLECTION</strong><br>- <strong>BLACK HOLES</strong> - they influence your trajectory and can absorb you<br>- <strong>GRAVITY</strong> - set your own direction of the gravity<br>- <strong>MOVING PLATFORMS</strong> - some platforms change their position over time<br>- Final level mechanics becomes available after finishing all the previous levels<br></li><li> Unusual style of graphics in every level (made on paper with pencil!)</li></ul>",
            "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/660760/extras/260e1b5740abfd5155d4f1585ddbdf5b.avif?t=1513538504\" width=612 height=104 /></span><br>Bouncing Odyssey is a logic puzzle game. Quite challenging puzzles and very unusual but attractive hand-drawn graphics (made on paper with PENCIL) are the main characteristics of the game.<br><br>Main mechanic is simple. Set your position and direction and, with the use of <i>the law of reflection</i>, you must escape the screen and simultaneously decolorize all the colored objects on the screen.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> 75 challenging and handcrafted levels + one <i>special final level</i><br></li><li> Four worlds with five different game mechanics:<br>- Basic mechanics - <strong>THE LAW OF REFLECTION</strong><br>- <strong>BLACK HOLES</strong> - they influence your trajectory and can absorb you<br>- <strong>GRAVITY</strong> - set your own direction of the gravity<br>- <strong>MOVING PLATFORMS</strong> - some platforms change their position over time<br>- Final level mechanics becomes available after finishing all the previous levels<br></li><li> Unusual style of graphics in every level (made on paper with pencil!)</li></ul>",
